  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 4.2% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $283.22B (4.2% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/circles-arc-token-sale-earnings-yields-usdc-income?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Circle\u2019s ARC token sale lifts earnings as lower yields weigh on USDC income</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/382493/usdc-issuer-circle-quietly-cuts-5-of-staff-in-profitable-quarter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">USDC Issuer Circle Quietly Cuts 5% of Staff in Profitable Quarter</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/hacks/binance-expands-proof-of-reserves-to-44-tokens-after-hack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Binance Expands Proof of Reserves to 44 Tokens After Hack</a> (The Defiant).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
